WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.416
Rat and Mole got the boat out.

2
00:00:03.417 --> 00:00:05.460
It was dark now.

3
00:00:05.461 --> 00:00:08.762
The moon shone on the water.

4
00:00:08.763 --> 00:00:12.864
Rat rowed them onto the river.

5
00:00:12.865 --> 00:00:17.382
"Our river looks so different at night," said Mole.

6
00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:21.408
"It looks like silver," sighed Rat.

7
00:00:21.409 --> 00:00:24.919
"I love my river at night."

8
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.417
"Let's tie up here," said Mole.

9
00:00:28.418 --> 00:00:31.627
He pointed to a willow tree.

10
00:00:31.628 --> 00:00:36.315
"Yes, it's a good place to start looking," said Rat.

11
00:00:36.316 --> 00:00:40.878
The friends got out and searched.

12
00:00:40.879 --> 00:00:43.697
"Nothing here," said Mole.

13
00:00:43.698 --> 00:00:48.177
He looked in some hollow trees.

14
00:00:48.178 --> 00:00:51.234
"Nothing here," said Rat.

15
00:00:51.235 --> 00:00:54.202
He climbed out of a ditch.

16
00:00:54.203 --> 00:00:56.813
They got back in the boat.

17
00:00:56.814 --> 00:01:00.605
Mole paddled them down the river again.

18
00:01:00.606 --> 00:01:03.362
A gentle wind came up.

19
00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:10.498
It moved the reeds along the banks.

20
00:01:10.499 --> 00:01:16.175
Rat sat up and said, "What's that sound?"

21
00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:20.038
"It's only the wind in the reeds," said Mole.

22
00:01:20.039 --> 00:01:23.413
"It's music!" cried Rat.

23
00:01:23.414 --> 00:01:25.355
"Can't you hear it?"

24
00:01:25.356 --> 00:01:29.508
"No," said Mole.

25
00:01:29.509 --> 00:01:32.689
"It's gone," said Rat.

26
00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:35.666
"It was so beautiful.

27
00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:39.566
It was like a song and a dream."

28
00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:42.998
"I didn't hear anything," said Mole.

29
00:01:42.999 --> 00:01:45.679
"Oh!" said Rat.

30
00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:49.551
"I've never heard such music!"

31
00:01:49.552 --> 00:01:53.345
"It's just the wind in the reeds," said Mole.

32
00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:55.842
"It's the wind in the willows."

33
00:01:55.843 --> 00:02:00.402
"The music is calling us, Mole!" cried Rat.

34
00:02:00.403 --> 00:02:03.077
"We must follow it!"

